              <div class="bg-white p-7 sm:p-9 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl relative">
                <div class="absolute -top-3 -right-3 bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 text-xs font-extrabold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">
                  Statewide Reach
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Our Commitment</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                  We don't believe in generic care templates. Every individual has distinct daily rhythms and expectations that we build our service around.
                </p>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                  <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-50 text-sky-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</div>
                    <div>
                      <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm">Experienced Personnel</p>
                      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Skilled caregivers dedicated to preserving personal autonomy and dignity.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-50 text-sky-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</div>
                    <div>
                      <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm">Customized Treatment Plans</p>
                      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Care designed around your preferred times, dietary habits, and routine.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>

