                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Personal Care</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                  Bathing, dressing, physical assistance, and morning or bedtime hygiene carried out with careful respect for client privacy.
                </p>
